{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":55246,"duration_api_ms":54950,"num_turns":18,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md` instead of making a new one. I haven't built or run any lesson, so the commands come from reading the Makefiles and CI workflows.\n\nThe file now covers what the old version left out:\n- **Two build styles:** lessons with a `Makefile` use libbpf. Lessons without one are built with `ecc` and run with `ecli` from eunomia-bpf.\n- **Makefile pattern:** each libbpf lesson's Makefile copies `src/11-bootstrap/Makefile`.\n- **Master Makefile:** `src/Makefile` builds or cleans every lesson that has a Makefile.\n- **Submodules:** `bpftool` and `blazesym` are git submodules and are empty on a plain clone. Builds fail until you run `git submodule update --init --recursive`.\n- **CI:** two workflows build a hand-picked list of lessons, so a new lesson isn't tested until it's added to one.\n- **Documentation conventions:**\n  - Every lesson needs both `README.md` and `README.zh.md`.\n  - The writing guidelines are in `src/scripts/`.\n  - The lesson index lives in four files and can be regenerated with `generate_toc.py`.\n\nI also fixed the old file's claim that Rust is the only non-C language. Lesson 31 has a Go server.\n\nI didn't check the topic groupings for lessons 30, 32, 33 and 36–40. I wrote them from the directory names, so check them before relying on them.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"aa78626d-2fa6-4ced-8e59-ddf9211de1bc","total_cost_usd":0.29514735000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":22,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21265,"cache_read_input_tokens":356042,"output_tokens":7235,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21265},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":494,"cache_read_input_tokens":44738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2325